{"4606150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rumble League", "steam_appid": 4606150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumble League is a chaotic multiplayer arcade football game. Unleash powerful shots, crush your opponents with devastating tackles, dodge deadly power-ups in fast-paced, unpredictable online or local matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/dbf988a23e9da28c2573e1a88a504d4b.poster.avif?t=1788248452\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/dbf988a23e9da28c2573e1a88a504d4b.webm?t=1788248452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/dbf988a23e9da28c2573e1a88a504d4b.mp4?t=1788248452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play against your friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock them out with crushing tackles as you carve your way to the goal, or send them flying into the electric fence for a shocking stun.<br>Use a wild arsenal of power-ups, from bombs and circular saws to spiked balls, wreaking havoc on the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/96f19308bc9a8527adcec60be6845a81.poster.avif?t=1788248452\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/96f19308bc9a8527adcec60be6845a81.webm?t=1788248452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/96f19308bc9a8527adcec60be6845a81.mp4?t=1788248452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash powerful shots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge the most unique and bizarre shots to beat the goalkeeper, from a thermo-nuclear shot to a ball summoning a black hole.<br>Bend shots to your will for a favorable deflect, assuming the goalkeeper survives the impact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/38ebda844a83dbb6a3ba2ed322ef306c.poster.avif?t=1788248452\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/38ebda844a83dbb6a3ba2ed322ef306c.webm?t=1788248452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/38ebda844a83dbb6a3ba2ed322ef306c.mp4?t=1788248452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your team from a roster of freaks and weirdos, each ready to crush the opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether they turn invisible, block shots with their ridiculous height, or cause chaos in their own special way, everyone is bringing something to the team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're all trying their best. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/0529e20e0b9eec409367d8d7ffe677da.poster.avif?t=1788248452\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/0529e20e0b9eec409367d8d7ffe677da.webm?t=1788248452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/0529e20e0b9eec409367d8d7ffe677da.mp4?t=1788248452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic, no-referee football matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online and local multiplayer battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters with distinct abilities and looks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating power-ups that can flip any match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-stop, over-the-top action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will ruin friendships</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumble League is a chaotic multiplayer arcade football game. Unleash powerful shots, crush your opponents with devastating tackles, dodge deadly power-ups in fast-paced, unpredictable online or local matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/dbf988a23e9da28c2573e1a88a504d4b.poster.avif?t=1788248452\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/dbf988a23e9da28c2573e1a88a504d4b.webm?t=1788248452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606150/extras/dbf988a23e9da28c2573e1a88a504d4b.mp4?t=1788248452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play against your friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock them out with crushing tackles as you carve your way to the goal, or send them flying into the electric fence for a shocking stun.<br>Use a wild arsenal of power-ups, from bombs and circular saws to spiked balls, wreaking havoc on the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steam